      "message": "Give anyone a place to say what broke, and hand it to whoever runs the forge\n\nAn alpha needs a door for bad news that does not depend on another\ncompany's issue tracker. /report takes what somebody did, where, and how\nto reach them, signed in or not, records the forge version with it, and\nkeeps it beside the waitlist rather than in the log, so a report can be\nremoved when the person asks. Whoever runs the forge reads them at\n/reports or with `cairn admin reports`, and, when the forge can send\nmail, hears of each at their confirmed address as it arrives, without\nanything to configure. The form is bounded and rate limited by source\nlike the waitlist. The README says where to report.\n\nChange-Id: Ireport0092door\nSigned-off-by: Mandip Adhikari <92096340+mandipadk@users.noreply.github.com>",
